 ploads/event/IMG_7584_20260609223358446445.JPG
DESCRIPTION:Join the WSAC Visibility Brigade each Wednesday morning to mak
 e VISIBLE our opposition to the endless corruption\, incompetence\, and im
 morality of the current regime. We display messages to commuters that aim 
 to ACTIVATE\, WAKE-UP\, and EMPATHIZE. Hundreds of people will see our mes
 sages in 60 minutes! We have a lot of fun and receive hundreds of honks\, 
 thumbs up\, and power fists. All you have to do it show up and wave! Detai
 ls provided upon registration. Look for the email you receive after you re
LOCATION:West Sacramento\, CA
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisibleyolo/event/855760/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Yolo (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
