DESCRIPTION:Join Indivisible Yolo in registering voters for the 2026 elect
 ions! Democracy functions best when people engage in conversations about w
 hat needs to be done. On campus at UCD on Wednesday\, we don't start by pu
 shing a form. Using the Field Team 6 model\, we ask questions and talk abo
 ut problems that need to be addressed. We talk about how voting can be a w
 ay to get decision makers who will address those problems. Then we make su
 re they have everything they need to vote on November 3. You can join 
LOCATION:UCD Quad\, Centennial Walk\, Meet at corner of Centennial Walk (p
 ath through center of grassy area) and cement quad\, University of Califor
 nia-Davis\, CA\, 95616
